Conflicts: Discovery

Purpose:
  Defines conflict detection and resolution rules.

DriftTypes:
  STACK_DRIFT:
    .sdd stack differs from source stack
  ARCHITECTURE_DRIFT:
    .sdd architecture differs from source architecture
  TASK_DRIFT:
    .sdd task status differs from source state
  DOC_DRIFT:
    .sdd documentation differs from source
  SECURITY_DRIFT:
    .sdd security controls differ from source
  TEST_DRIFT:
    .sdd test claims differ from source tests
  INFRA_DRIFT:
    .sdd infrastructure differs from source
  DECISION_DRIFT:
    .sdd decisions differ from source implementation

ConflictResolution:
  Principle:
    Analyze ≠ Modify

  Process:
    DETECT
      ↓
    REPORT
      ↓
    HUMAN/AGENT DECISION
      ↓
    .sdd UPDATE (if approved)

ConflictReporting:
  Format:
    Conflict:
      STACK_DRIFT

    .sdd:
      Cache: Redis

    Source:
      Redis + Memcached

    Evidence:
      - redis.conf
      - memcached.conf
      - Both clients in go.mod

    Recommendation:
      Update .sdd or remove Memcached

ConflictRules:
  [CO1]  Discovery MUST detect all drift types.
  [CO2]  Discovery MUST report conflicts, not fix them.
  [CO3]  Discovery MUST provide evidence for each conflict.
  [CO4]  Discovery MUST recommend resolution, not enforce it.
  [CO5]  .sdd MUST NOT be modified without explicit decision.

State: +
  